    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "It is a rank three Gu. It can search a portion of the memories stored in the soul. The memories it returns are very disordered, and it cannot be used frequently: overuse can confuse the soul, blur consciousness, and harm the user. Fei Chang still uses it, and from the plundered memories he learns of a nearby hidden path.",
